# ============================================================
#  Files excluded from the Vercel deployment
# ============================================================

node_modules/
docs/
legacy/
supabase/
*.md

# --- secrets: must never reach the deployment ---
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# --- build tooling IS required (npm run build) - do not exclude scripts/ ---

# NOTE: never use a bare `uploads/` here either. It would also exclude
# api/uploads/, which holds a Serverless Function.

# --- data/: only these three are used at runtime ---
#   content.default.json  bundled into the serverless function
#   content-schema.json   bundled into the serverless function
#   content.json          offline fallback when the API is unreachable
# The rest are input for `npm run seed` only, so they stay out of the
# bundle. Excluding passcode.json also keeps its hash off the deployment.
data/appointments.json
data/passcode.json
data/doctors.json
data/specialties.json
data/services.json
data/sectionCopy.json
data/clinicInfo.json
data/conditions.json
data/therapies.json
data/directory.json
data/blogposts.json
data/booking-options.json
data/gallery.json

.vscode/
.vercel
*.log